The package kio provides CMake targets:

    find_package(KF6KIO CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE KF6::KIOCore KF6::KIOGui KF6::KIOWidgets KF6::KIOFileWidgets)

KIO runs some operations in the helper executables kioworker and kioexec, which
it looks for next to the application and in PATH: applications using them must
deploy them from tools/kio next to their executable, or add tools/kio to PATH.
